Feature addition: settings menu with GPU info, graphics, performance, audio tabs.

This commit modifies 7 files (+1686 lines), spanning 5 UI/HUD, 2 other.
This feature extends the Geometry Wars 3D codebase with new functionality. The implementation follows the project's established patterns and maintains compatibility with both single-player and multiplayer code paths where applicable.

Additional context from the commit body:
- SettingsMenu: 4-tab settings overlay (GPU Info, Graphics, Performance, Audio)
- GPUBenchmark: entity count benchmark (100-5000) with FPS measurement
- Quality presets: ultra/high/medium/low/minimal with per-knob tuning
- Audio settings: master/SFX/music volume + music preset selection
- All settings persist via localStorage
- Accessible from both start menu and pause menu
- 40 new tests covering defaults, save/load, presets, edge cases

Key files: package-lock.json, package.json, src/ui/GPUBenchmark.ts, src/ui/PauseMenu.ts, src/ui/SettingsMenu.test.ts, and others.
